sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Farmer
  participant UI as Mobile / Web UI
  participant API as Flask API
  participant Auth as Session Control
  participant Guard as Image Validator
  participant Tassel as Tassel Predictor
  participant Disease as Disease Predictor
  participant Advice as Bilingual Advice Engine
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Store as Encrypted Storage

  Farmer->>UI: Select maize field or leaf photo
  UI->>API: Multipart upload + Bearer token
  API->>Auth: Reload current user, role, status, permissions
  Auth->>DB: Read user and session_version
  DB-->>Auth: Current active account
  Auth-->>API: Authorized identity
  API->>Guard: Enforce byte, MIME, decode, pixel limits
  Guard-->>API: UUID name + SHA-256 + dimensions
  API->>Store: Encrypt validated bytes
  API->>DB: Save Image metadata and encrypted blob
  alt Tassel counting
    API->>Tassel: Infer by content digest and active model
    Tassel-->>API: Count, boxes, confidence, timing
    API->>DB: Save DetectionResult
  else Leaf screening
    API->>Disease: Quality gate and calibrated classification
    Disease-->>API: Condition evidence or retake state
    API->>Advice: Add context and selected language
    Advice-->>API: Human-centred observations and next steps
    API->>DB: Save DiseaseDiagnosis
  end
  API-->>UI: Structured bilingual result
  UI-->>Farmer: Clear outcome, uncertainty, and next action
